      "description": "For tree : Tree (\u211d \u00d7 \u211d), define exactProductTree tree := tree.map (fun p => p.1 * p.2), roundedProductTree model tree := tree.map (fun p => model.mul p.1 p.2), and roundedDotProduct model tree := roundedSum model (roundedProductTree model tree). These must preserve the original reduction shape and perform rounding on every product and every internal addition."
