      "description": "Establish IsPerturbation model.u (exactProductTree tree) (roundedProductTree model tree) by structural induction. At a leaf use model.round_spec (a*b) to obtain \u03b4 with |\u03b4| \u2264 u and round(a*b) = (a*b)*(1+\u03b4); bound the absolute difference by u*|a*b| using absolute-value multiplication and commutativity. At nodes combine the two child relations. This construction must also handle zero and negative products without division."
