      "id": "depth-and-smallness",
      "description": "Use Tree.depth_map to identify the rounded product tree depth with tree.depth. From (((tree.depth + 1 : \u2115) : \u211d) * model.u < 1) and model.u_nonneg derive ((tree.depth : \u211d) * model.u < 1). Manage Nat-to-real casts explicitly so that the hypothesis counts depth plus one rounding operations."
