      "id": "addition-witness",
      "description": "Apply roundedSum_exists_perturbation to roundedProductTree model tree under the derived depth smallness. Obtain perturbed : Tree \u211d with IsPerturbation (gamma tree.depth model.u) (roundedProductTree model tree) perturbed and perturbed.exactSum = roundedDotProduct model tree, simplifying mapped depth and the algorithm definition."
    },
