      "id": "compose-and-bound",
      "description": "Prove gamma tree.depth model.u is nonnegative using gamma_nonneg and the derived smallness, then apply IsPerturbation.trans to the multiplication relation and addition witness. Rewrite its bound model.u + gamma tree.depth model.u * (1 + model.u) as gamma tree.depth model.u + model.u * (1 + gamma tree.depth model.u). Use gamma_step at tree.depth with the original smallness and IsPerturbation.mono to reach gamma (tree.depth + 1) model.u."
    },
