      "id": "full-original-theorem",
      "description": "State and establish for every model : Model and tree : Tree (\u211d \u00d7 \u211d), assuming only (((tree.depth + 1 : \u2115) : \u211d) * model.u < 1), the conclusion \u2203 perturbed : Tree \u211d, IsPerturbation (gamma (tree.depth + 1) model.u) (exactProductTree tree) perturbed \u2227 perturbed.exactSum = roundedDotProduct model tree. Its witness gives the exact computed value as a sum of perturbed exact products, each leaf satisfying |y - a*b| \u2264 gamma (depth+1) u * |a*b|. Do not weaken this to perturbations of already rounded products or assume the desired existence."
